"Tapping the Toniebox 2 to skip forward and back isn't working – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-us/articles/29422120806546-Tapping-the-Toniebox-2-to-skip-forward-and-back-isn-t-working)\nciteturn1007view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; Content type: text/html; Source: click({\"ref_id\":\"turn1006view0\",\"id\":10}); Total lines: 46\nL0: 【0†Skip to main content】\nL1: \nL2: 【1†Contact us】\nL3: \nL4: [Input] English (United States)\nL5: \nL6: Articles in this section\nL7:   * 【2†How do I restart the Toniebox 2?】\nL8:   * 【3†How to reset your Toniebox 2 to factory settings】\nL9:   * 【4†My Toniebox 2 is stuck, what do I do?】\nL10:   * 【5†What can I do if my Toniebox 2 isn’t turning on?】\nL11:   * 【6†Why does my Toniebox 2 not play a Tonie when it is plugged in?】\nL12:   * 【7†My Tonie isn't playing】\nL13:   * 【8†Tonie is playing the audio from a different Tonie】\nL14:   * 【9†Toniebox 2 download speed seems slow】\nL15:   * 【10†Tapping the Toniebox 2 to skip forward and back isn't working】\nL16:   * 【11†My Tonie/Creative Tonie is not playing the updated content on the Toniebox 2】\nL17: # Tapping the Toniebox 2 to skip forward and back isn't working\nL18: \nL19: If your Toniebox 2 isn’t skipping tracks when you give it a tap, don’t worry—it may just need to turn off and back on again. Your Toniebox 2 will turn off automatically on its own after five minutes of no activity. When it wakes up again, the tapping magic should be back in action.\nL20: \nL21: 【12†Return to top】\nL22: \nL23: Return to top\nL24: ## Was this article helpful?\nL25: \nL26: [Button: Yes] [Button: No]\nL27: \nL28: 61 out of 455 found this helpful\nL29: \nL30: Have more questions? 【1†Submit a request】\nL31: \nL32: ### In this article\nL33: \nL34: Contents Articles\nL35: \nL36: ### Title\nL37: \nL38: [Button: ×]\nL39: \nL40: 【13†tonies® Support】\nL41: \nL42:   * 【14†Imprint†login.tonies.com】\nL43:   * 【15†Privacy policy†login.tonies.com】\nL44:   * 【16†Cookie Settings】\nL45:   * © tonies GmbH\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMy Tonie isn't playing – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-us/articles/29544159642514-My-Tonie-isn-t-playing)\nciteturn1007view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: click({\"ref_id\":\"turn1006view0\",\"id\":7}); Total lines: 63\nL0: 【0†Skip to main content】\nL1: \nL2: 【1†Contact us】\nL3: \nL4: [Input] English (United States)\nL5: \nL6: Articles in this section\nL7:   * 【2†How do I restart the Toniebox 2?】\nL8:   * 【3†How to reset your Toniebox 2 to factory settings】\nL9:   * 【4†My Toniebox 2 is stuck, what do I do?】\nL10:   * 【5†What can I do if my Toniebox 2 isn’t turning on?】\nL11:   * 【6†Why does my Toniebox 2 not play a Tonie when it is plugged in?】\nL12:   * 【7†My Tonie isn't playing】\nL13:   * 【8†Tonie is playing the audio from a different Tonie】\nL14:   * 【9†Toniebox 2 download speed seems slow】\nL15:   * 【10†Tapping the Toniebox 2 to skip forward and back isn't working】\nL16:   * 【11†My Tonie/Creative Tonie is not playing the updated content on the Toniebox 2】\nL17: # My Tonie isn't playing\nL18: \nL19: Some Toniebox 2 customers have had trouble downloading Tonies recently. The issue has now been fixed, but you’ll need to update your Toniebox 2 to make sure everything runs smoothly.\nL20: \nL21: \nL22: \nL23: Here’s how to do it:\nL24: \nL25:   1. Switch on your Toniebox 2.\nL26: \nL27:   2. Wait until it turns off again by itself.\nL28: \nL29:   3. Switch it back on.\nL30: \nL31:   4. Wait for it to connect to the internet (you can check the connection in the tonies® app).\nL32:   5. In the tonies® app, tap your Toniebox 2 to check its firmware version. It should now display v1.6 or later.\nL33: \nL34:   6. That’s it! Your Toniebox 2 is updated and ready to play Tonies again.\nL35: \nL36: If you run into any problems, or if your firmware doesn’t update to v1.6 or later please get in touch with our Customer Happiness team who’ll be glad to help.\nL37: \nL38: 【12†Return to top】\nL39: \nL40: Return to top\nL41: ## Was this article helpful?\nL42: \nL43: [Button: Yes] [Button: No]\nL44: \nL45: 128 out of 5088 found this helpful\nL46: \nL47: Have more questions? 【1†Submit a request】\nL48: \nL49: ### In this article\nL50: \nL51: Contents Articles\nL52: \nL53: ### Title\nL54: \nL55: [Button: ×]\nL56: \nL57: 【13†tonies® Support】\nL58: \nL59:   * 【14†Imprint†login.tonies.com】\nL60:   * 【15†Privacy policy†login.tonies.com】\nL61:   * 【16†Cookie Settings】\nL62:   * © tonies GmbH\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMy Tonie/Creative Tonie is not playing the updated content on the Toniebox 2 – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-us/articles/34276878021138-My-Tonie-Creative-Tonie-is-not-playing-the-updated-content-on-the-Toniebox-2)\nciteturn1007view2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 days ago; Content type: text/html; Source: click({\"ref_id\":\"turn1006view0\",\"id\":11}); Total lines: 66\nL0: 【0†Skip to main content】\nL1: \nL2: 【1†Contact us】\nL3: \nL4: [Input] English (United States)\nL5: \nL6: Articles in this section\nL7:   * 【2†How do I restart the Toniebox 2?】\nL8:   * 【3†How to reset your Toniebox 2 to factory settings】\nL9:   * 【4†My Toniebox 2 is stuck, what do I do?】\nL10:   * 【5†What can I do if my Toniebox 2 isn’t turning on?】\nL11:   * 【6†Why does my Toniebox 2 not play a Tonie when it is plugged in?】\nL12:   * 【7†My Tonie isn't playing】\nL13:   * 【8†Tonie is playing the audio from a different Tonie】\nL14:   * 【9†Toniebox 2 download speed seems slow】\nL15:   * 【10†Tapping the Toniebox 2 to skip forward and back isn't working】\nL16:   * 【11†My Tonie/Creative Tonie is not playing the updated content on the Toniebox 2】\nL17: # My Tonie/Creative Tonie is not playing the updated content on the Toniebox 2\nL18: \nL19: If you have edited the audio content on your Tonie or Creative Tonie but your Toniebox 2 is still playing the old content, there are two possible reasons for this:\nL20: \nL21:   1. Your Toniebox 2 isn’t connected to Wi-Fi:\nL22: Check whether your Toniebox 2 is connected to Wi-Fi. To do this, open the tonies app and tap on your Toniebox 2. It can take up to 30 seconds after starting the Toniebox 2 for it to appear as “online”. If it still shows as “offline”, you’ll need to reconnect it to your Wi-Fi. You can do this easily by tapping the “Connect Toniebox” button.\nL23: \nL24: \nL25: \nL26:   2. The Tonie or Creative Tonie was placed on the Toniebox 2 too soon:\nL27: Unlike the Toniebox 1, the Toniebox 2 synchronises automatically. On the Toniebox 2, this happens around 30 seconds after it has been switched on. If your Toniebox 2 is connected to Wi-Fi and you have already placed the Tonie/Creative Tonie on it before synchronisation, the synchronisation process will be prevented.\nL28: ### How can you ensure the new content is played?\nL29: #### Restart the Toniebox 2\nL30: \nL31:   * Make sure your Toniebox 2 is switched on and NOT connected to a power source.\nL32:   * Press and hold both ears for 60 seconds until the Toniebox 2 switches off. We recommend using a timer to ensure you hold them for the full 60 seconds.\nL33:   * Be sure to keep holding the ears down, regardless of what the display shows in the meantime.\nL34:   * Reconnect the Toniebox to a power source.\nL35:   * If the light ring is lit and the Toniebox is making sounds again, it has worked.\nL36: #### Wait until the Toniebox 2 switches off:\nL37: \nL38: Alternatively, you can wait until the Toniebox 2 has switched off. This happens automatically after five minutes of inactivity. Then switch on the Toniebox 2, which is connected to the Wi-Fi, and wait for at least 30 seconds before placing the Tonie or Creative Tonie on it.\nL39: We're confident this should get you back on track and hearing the right content. Should this not be the case, simply reach out to our Customer Happiness team, confirming which steps you have followed so we can support you further.\nL40: \nL41: 【12†Return to top】\nL42: \nL43: Return to top\nL44: ## Was this article helpful?\nL45: \nL46: [Button: Yes] [Button: No]\nL47: \nL48: 8 out of 71 found this helpful\nL49: \nL50: Have more questions? 【1†Submit a request】\nL51: \nL52: ### In this article\nL53: \nL54: Contents Articles\nL55: \nL56: ### Title\nL57: \nL58: [Button: ×]\nL59: \nL60: 【13†tonies® Support】\nL61: \nL62:   * 【14†Imprint†login.tonies.com】\nL63:   * 【15†Privacy policy†login.tonies.com】\nL64:   * 【16†Cookie Settings】\nL65:   * © tonies GmbH\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nToniebox 2 download speed seems slow – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-us/articles/29254033744914-Toniebox-2-download-speed-seems-slow)\nciteturn1007view3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 6 days ago; Content type: text/html; Source: click({\"ref_id\":\"turn1006view0\",\"id\":9}); Total lines: 63\nL0: 【0†Skip to main content】\nL1: \nL2: 【1†Contact us】\nL3: \nL4: [Input] English (United States)\nL5: \nL6: Articles in this section\nL7:   * 【2†How do I restart the Toniebox 2?】\nL8:   * 【3†How to reset your Toniebox 2 to factory settings】\nL9:   * 【4†My Toniebox 2 is stuck, what do I do?】\nL10:   * 【5†What can I do if my Toniebox 2 isn’t turning on?】\nL11:   * 【6†Why does my Toniebox 2 not play a Tonie when it is plugged in?】\nL12:   * 【7†My Tonie isn't playing】\nL13:   * 【8†Tonie is playing the audio from a different Tonie】\nL14:   * 【9†Toniebox 2 download speed seems slow】\nL15:   * 【10†Tapping the Toniebox 2 to skip forward and back isn't working】\nL16:   * 【11†My Tonie/Creative Tonie is not playing the updated content on the Toniebox 2】\nL17: # Toniebox 2 download speed seems slow\nL18: \nL19: When you place a new Tonie or Tonieplay Disc on your Toniebox 2, the fun doesn’t always start instantly. Before your story, song, or audio adventure can begin, the Toniebox 2 needs to download the opening chapter from our servers or the full game for a Tonieplay Disc.\nL20: What to expect:\nL21: Tonies - Normal wait time: usually just 5–10 seconds for a Tonie. Please note the Tonie will only begin to play once the first chapter has downloaded.\nL22: Tonieplay - Normal wait time is up to 30 minutes for a Tonieplay Disc.\nL23: \nL24: The Light Ring will display the download progress to keep you updated.\nL25: Occasional longer wait:\nL26: With slower internet or busy servers, it might take longer, up to an hour or more, so please allow some extra time beyond these times. Note that our longer games, like Quizzles, will take the longest time to download.\nL27: Download interrupted?\nL28:   * If a Tonie gets stuck during download and doesn’t progress, remove it from the Toniebox 2, wait a few seconds, and try again. If the issue persists, restart the Toniebox 2.\nL29:   * If you encounter any hiccups during your download, like your Tonieplay disc is removed from the Toniebox 2, then no need to worry! The download will continue in the background, and once completed the Tonieplay game will be ready to play.\nL30: \nL31: Tips to speed things up:\nL32:   * Make sure your Toniebox 2 has a stable Wi-Fi network.\nL33:   * Move it closer to your router if you can.\nL34:   * A quick router restart can help if things are sluggish.\nL35:   * If your internet connection is on the leisurely side, give that first download a little extra time.\nL36:   * Once the first download is complete, your Toniebox 2 stores the content. That means all future playbacks start instantly, with or without Wi-Fi.\nL37: \nL38: 【12†Return to top】\nL39: \nL40: Return to top\nL41: ## Was this article helpful?\nL42: \nL43: [Button: Yes] [Button: No]\nL44: \nL45: 53 out of 105 found this helpful\nL46: \nL47: Have more questions? 【1†Submit a request】\nL48: \nL49: ### In this article\nL50: \nL51: Contents Articles\nL52: \nL53: ### Title\nL54: \nL55: [Button: ×]\nL56: \nL57: 【13†tonies® Support】\nL58: \nL59:   * 【14†Imprint†login.tonies.com】\nL60:   * 【15†Privacy policy†login.tonies.com】\nL61:   * 【16†Cookie Settings】\nL62:   * © tonies GmbH\n"
